  "name": "rofacial Myofunctional Therapy Dataset for Obstructive Sleep Apnea",
  "description": "This dataset contains anonymized clinical data from a cohort of 87 adult patients with obstructive sleep apnea (OSA) and primary snoring (PS), treated with AI-assisted Orofacial Myofunctional Therapy (OMT) using Smart Therapy Manager. The dataset supports the study on telemedicine-enhanced interventions for improving adherence and patient outcomes.",
